y verified Undefined; it does not set persistent execution policy and never overrides GPO. Preserve default-policy failures and report exact launch mode instead of claiming default-policy pass. This replaces prior S2 operator process-Bypass launch with RemoteSigned, not broader rights. Preserve actual command/rc/output/proof before and after. Re-run unchanged S2 normal26 in same candidate deployment tree on both runtimes to check packaging coexistence; original H4 focused38 evidence is unchanged-code context only, NOT claimed newly run. Focused38/24children rerun only if actual concerns arise, not routinely.\nLinux exactH before primary push: full tlselftest N/N childrc0, Ruff F delta0 vsB (bare rc retained), temporary manifest strict verified, gitdiffcheck, doctrine-scan/adr-song and documentation/release claim checks appropriate to new SKILL. Canonical unmodified admission/source/runtime before heavy gates. No root VERSION or committed release manifest write.\nFresh independent Codex CLI gpt-6.1-sol/xhigh ENTIRE B..H/spec/security in separate read-only clone/context; executor is gpt-6.1-sol/high, so reviewer effort is higher. Valid v2 receipt/exact original Issue delivery before any push. Record same-provider only and keep sensitive assurance hold: code correctness verdict does not authorize promotion without protocol-sufficient independent assurance. Product author cannot approve self; preserve historical author handoff NOT_RUN, operator gates separately.\nONE primary productpush after native/Linux/offline approval; DraftPR, exactH connector review, applicable required UbuntuCI alljobs/actual4anchors/fullsource+mandatorytl-auditor, canonicalK0-K7/currentrules/fullreffence. Ready may trigger another actualautomatic review, wait terminal0openfindings before normal guardedmerge. No admin/bypass/auto-merge/branch deletion. ActualM^2H/parents/tree/currentfirstparent; exactM UbuntuCI4anchors/officiallifecycleartifactdigest/fullsource+AUX before M8/readback/lease actual