{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SG3j9SL6GwSchneZA5cVXh","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tdiff --git a/.agents/skills/proxima-control/SKILL.md b/.agents/skills/proxima-control/SKILL.md\n2\tnew file mode 100644\n3\tindex 0000000..88f0376\n4\t--- /dev/null\n5\t+++ b/.agents/skills/proxima-control/SKILL.md\n6\t@@ -0,0 +1,64 @@\n7\t+---\n8\t+name: proxima-control\n9\t+description: Điều khiển MỘT đích Proxima khai báo tường minh qua px hoặc Run-Px.ps1 (trợ giúp, cấu hình, trạng thái, model, hỏi, start/stop/restart, connect/disconnect), luôn kèm ConfigPath, RepositoryRoot, TargetId và dùng -WhatIf để xem trước.\n10\t+version: 2.0.0\n11\t+---\n12\t+## Phạm vi (Scope)\n13\t+- Add-on tùy chọn, độc lập, chỉ công bố trong repository để dễ tìm: không tự cài, không tự kích hoạt, không đổi endpoint, dịch vụ,\n14\t+  tài khoản hay profile. `.agents/` nằm trong `_RELEASE_EXCLUDE_DIRS` của bộ đóng gói lõi nên add-on KHÔNG vào gói Package của\n15\t+  tra-luat; xoá thư mục add-on thì skill lõi vẫn nguyên vẹn.\n16\t+- Thành phần: `scripts/ProximaConfig.psm1` (S1, đọc cấu hình), `scripts/ProximaControl.psm1` + `scripts/Run-Px.ps1` (S2) và\n17\t+  `scripts/ProximaControl.psd1` (S3, manifest dữ liệu thuần); `config.example.json` chỉ chứa giá trị giả.\n18\t+- Câu trả lời từ model, AI hay web là dữ liệu CHƯA tin cậy; trích nguyên văn pháp luật vẫn theo [SKILL.md gốc](../../../SKILL.md) và nguồn\n19\t+  đã kiểm chứng. Quy trình packet, review, land: [protocol](../../../docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.md) (không chép lại ở đây).\n20\t+\n21\t+## Điểm vào (Entry points)\n22\t+Đường dẫn tính từ gốc repository; `<RepoRoot>` là chỗ giữ:\n23\t+```powershell\n24\t+Import-Module -Name '<RepoRoot>\\.agents\\skills\\proxima-control\\scripts\\ProximaControl.psd1' -DisableNameChecking\n25\t+px help\n26\t+& '<RepoRoot>\\.agents\\skills\\proxima-control\\scripts\\Run-Px.ps1' help\n27\t+```\n28\t+- Manifest chỉ khai `RootModule` là `ProximaControl.psm1` và đúng hai hàm `px`, `Invoke-ProximaOperation`; không nạp sẵn S1.\n29\t+  Hỗ trợ Windows PowerShell 5.1 (Desktop) và PowerShell 7 (Core).\n30\t+- Trạng thái (session, model đã chọn) chỉ sống trong tiến trình hiện tại; tiến trình mới luôn bắt đầu chưa kết nối.\n31\t+- Wrapper chỉ tái dùng module đã nạp nếu đường dẫn của nó đúng là `scripts/ProximaControl.psm1` bên cạnh (cùng instance, giữ trạng thái);\n32\t+  nạp từ chỗ khác, hoặc runtime báo đường dẫn khác, thì dừng với `ProximaControl.ModuleConflict`, không reset, không nạp đè.\n33\t+- Đừng `Import-Module -Force` lần nữa (mất session và lựa chọn). Gỡ bằng `Remove-Module ProximaControl`: đóng session do module\n34\t+  sở hữu và mất toàn bộ trạng thái.\n35\t+\n36\t+## Mục tiêu (Target)\n37\t+Mọi hành động trừ `help` cần đủ `-ConfigPath`, `-RepositoryRoot`, `-TargetId` (khớp Ordinal với tệp cấu hình). Không đích mặc định,\n38\t+không dò môi trường hay thư mục hiện hành, không tự kết nối. Giá trị trong `<...>` là chỗ giữ:\n39\t+```powershell\n40\t+px config -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>'\n41\t+px models '<provider>' -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>'\n42\t+px use '<provider>' '<provider>/<model>' -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>'\n43\t+px ask '<provider>' 'Nội dung câu hỏi' -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>'\n44\t+px connect -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>' -Credential (Get-Credential)\n45\t+```\n46\t+- Chỉ `connect` nhận `-Credential` (PSCredential); hành động khác không hỏi và không đọc thông tin đăng nhập.\n47\t+- Không suy diễn: `ask` khi chưa `use` (và không có `-Model`) báo `NoModelSelected`; model không được quảng bá báo\n48\t+  `ModelNotAdvertised`. Không fallback sang model hay đích khác, không tự thử lại.\n49\t+\n50\t+## Xem trước (WhatIf)\n51\t+`px` gọi ShouldProcess TRƯỚC mọi tác động, kể cả truy vấn `status`/`models`; mọi hành động có `-WhatIf` và `-Confirm`, wrapper chuyển\n52\t+tiếp đúng hai cờ ấy. `-Force` chỉ vượt chốt \"còn yêu cầu đang chờ\" của `stop`/`restart`, KHÔNG BAO GIỜ vượt `-WhatIf`:\n53\t+```powershell\n54\t+px restart -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>' -Force -WhatIf\n55\t+& '<RepoRoot>\\.agents\\skills\\proxima-control\\scripts\\Run-Px.ps1' stop -ConfigPath '<ConfigPath>' -RepositoryRoot '<RepoRoot>' -TargetId '<TargetId>' -WhatIf\n56\t+```\n57\t+\n58\t+## Phiên bản (Versions)\n59\t+Ba miền danh tính tách biệt, không suy miền này từ miền kia:\n60\t+1. Add-on trong repository: `ModuleVersion` 2.0.0 của manifest, cộng commit và tree Git chứa nó. Major 2 tách khỏi module 1.0.1\n61\t+   đã thấy ở P0; không khẳng định module trên máy chủ đã được cập nhật.\n62\t+2. Module điều khiển đã cài trên endpoint: cặp băm `moduleSha256` + `configModuleSha256` do handshake trả về khi `connect`.\n63\t+3. Gateway runtime: `FileVersion` của `Proxima.exe` là NOT_MEASURED ở S2/S3; đo nó thuộc quan sát P4, không lén thêm vào S2.\n64\t+   `status`/`models` không xác lập phiên bản runtime, quota, xác thực hay danh tính model upstream.\n65\t+\n66\t+## Giới hạn (Limits)\n67\t+- Kiểm listener là ảnh chụp và kiểm băm rồi mới import cũng vậy: đổi tiến trình/cổng/tệp chen giữa là race đã khai. Xác thực WinRM\n68\t+  thật chưa được đo; băm chỉ ràng tương thích mã, không chứng thực máy chủ; dịch vụ bọc (kiểu NSSM) bị từ chối.\n69\t+- Kiểm thử: `tests/ProximaManifest.Tests.ps1` (manifest, tài liệu), `tests/ProximaControl.Tests.ps1` (S2), `tests/ProximaConfig.Tests.ps1`\n70\t+  (S1). Một lượt xanh không chứng minh bản đã triển khai trên máy nào.\n71\tdiff --git a/.agents/skills/proxima-control/scripts/ProximaControl.psd1 b/.agents/skills/proxima-control/scripts/ProximaControl.psd1\n72\tnew file mode 100644\n73\tindex 0000000..6acb20d\n74\t--- /dev/null\n75\t+++ b/.agents/skills/proxima-control/scripts/ProximaControl.psd1\n76\t@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@\n77\t+# ProximaControl.psd1 - wp1285 r1 (PROXIMA-P1-S3). Pure data manifest for the sibling ProximaControl.psm1 (S2): nine keys only.\n78\t+# No NestedModules/RequiredModules/ScriptsToProcess: S1 ProximaConfig.psm1 is still loaded only by the S2 hash-before-import guard.\n79\t+@{\n80\t+    RootModule           = 'ProximaControl.psm1'\n81\t+    ModuleVersion        = '2.0.0'\n82\t+    GUID                 = '7f7055d6-51e3-4fb8-bbeb-7851a739bfb6'\n83\t+    PowerShellVersion    = '5.1'\n84\t+    CompatiblePSEditions = @('Desktop', 'Core')\n85\t+    FunctionsToExport    = @('px', 'Invoke-ProximaOperation')\n86\t+    CmdletsToExport      = @()\n87\t+    VariablesToExport    = @()\n88\t+    AliasesToExport      = @()\n89\t+}\n90\tdiff --git a/.agents/skills/proxima-control/tests/ProximaManifest.Tests.ps1 b/.agents/skills/proxima-control/tests/ProximaManifest.Tests.ps1\n91\tnew file mode 100644\n92\tindex 0000000..27b6836\n93\t--- /dev/null\n94\t+++ b/.agents/skills/proxima-control/tests/ProximaManifest.Tests.ps1\n95\t@@ -0,0 +1,373 @@\n96\t+# ProximaManifest.Tests.ps1 - wp1285 r1 (PROXIMA-P1-S3): self-contained harness (no Pester) for scripts/ProximaControl.psd1 (M1) + SKILL.md (M2).\n97\t+#   powershell.exe|pwsh.exe -NoProfile -NonInteractive -File <copy>\\ProximaManifest.Tests.ps1 -AddonRoot <tree>\\.agents\\skills\\proxima-control `\n98\t+#     -ScratchRoot <existing dir outside the repository> -ReportPath <json outside the add-on> [-Counterexamples]\n99\t+# rc 0: PM01..PM07 (+CX00..CX04) passed, evidence re-verified. rc 1: a property failed (no manifest/SKILL => all seven run and fail\n100\t+# MANIFEST_ABSENT/SKILL_ABSENT). rc 2: setup error or unavailable runtime only. PM01/PM02 judge the manifest STATICALLY (AST + SafeGetValue);\n101\t+# Fresh children call help only: 'runtime' = PM03+PM06, 'tamper' = PM04. Evidence is retained and re-hashed; children inherit policy.\n102\t+using namespace System.Management.Automation.Language\n103\t+[CmdletBinding()]\n104\t+param([Parameter(Mandatory = $true)][string]$AddonRoot, [Parameter(Mandatory = $true)][string]$ScratchRoot,\n105\t+    [Parameter(Mandatory = $true)][string]$ReportPath, [switch]$Counterexamples)\n106\t+Set-StrictMode -Version 3.0\n107\t+$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\n108\t+$Ids = 'PM01', 'PM02', 'PM03', 'PM04', 'PM05', 'PM06', 'PM07'\n109\t+$Want = @{ RootModule = 'ProximaControl.psm1'; ModuleVersion = '2.0.0'; GUID = '7f7055d6-51e3-4fb8-bbeb-7851a739bfb6'; PowerShellVersion = '5.1' }\n110\t+$WantArrays = [ordered]@{ CompatiblePSEditions = @('Desktop', 'Core'); FunctionsToExport = @('px', 'Invoke-ProximaOperation'); CmdletsToExport = @()\n111\t+    VariablesToExport = @(); AliasesToExport = @() }\n112\t+$KeySet = [Collections.Generic.HashSet[string]]::new([string[]](@($Want.Keys) + @($WantArrays.Keys)), [StringComparer]::Ordinal)\n113\t+$PxActions = [Collections.Generic.HashSet[string]]::new([string[]]('help config status models use ask start stop restart connect disconnect' -split ' '), [StringComparer]::Ordinal)\n114\t+$Legacy = 'scripts/ProximaConfig.psm1', 'scripts/ProximaControl.psm1', 'scripts/Run-Px.ps1', 'config.example.json', 'tests/ProximaConfig.Tests.ps1', 'tests/ProximaControl.Tests.ps1'\n115\t+$Tags = 'Scope', 'Entry points', 'Target', 'WhatIf', 'Versions', 'Limits'\n116\t+$Utf8 = [Text.UTF8Encoding]::new($false, $true); $Sha = [Security.Cryptography.SHA256]::Create(); $Inv = [Globalization.CultureInfo]::InvariantCulture\n117\t+$Results = [Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new(); $Artifacts = [Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new(); $Children = [Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new()\n118\t+$Report = [ordered]@{ schema = 'proxima_manifest_tests.v1'; ps_version = \"$($PSVersionTable.PSVersion)\"; ps_edition = \"$($PSVersionTable.PSEdition)\"\n119\t+    culture = [Globalization.CultureInfo]::CurrentCulture.Name; ui_culture = [Globalization.CultureInfo]::CurrentUICulture.Name; launch = $null; addon_root = $AddonRoot\n120\t+    harness_sha256 = $null; git_head = 'not_measured (no git in harness; the operator records H/tree)'; source_hashes = $null; manifest_state = 'unknown'\n121\t+    skill_state = 'unknown'; setup_error = $null; required_ids = @(); total = 0; passed = 0; failed_ids = @(); setup_error_ids = @(); runtime_children = 0; tamper = $null\n122\t+    cases = $Results; children = $Children; counterexamples = [Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new(); evidence = [ordered]@{ dir = $null; artifacts = $Artifacts; check = $null }; cleanup = $null }\n123\t+$Run = $null; $Completing = $false\n124\t+function Get-FileSha([string]$P) { if ([IO.File]::Exists($P)) { ([BitConverter]::ToString($Sha.ComputeHash([IO.File]::ReadAllBytes($P))) -replace '-', '').ToLowerInvariant() } }\n125\t+function Join-Addon([string]$Base, [string]$Rel) { [IO.Path]::Combine($Base, $Rel.Replace([char]'/', [IO.Path]::DirectorySeparatorChar)) }\n126\t+function Test-Inside([string]$Path, [string]$Dir) { $s = [IO.Path]::DirectorySeparatorChar; ($Path.TrimEnd($s) + $s).StartsWith($Dir.TrimEnd($s) + $s, [StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase) }\n127\t+function Add-Artifact([string]$Role, [string]$Path) { $Artifacts.Add([ordered]@{ role = $Role; path = $Path; sha256 = (Get-FileSha $Path) }) }\n128\t+function Save-Text([string]$Role, [string]$Path, [string]$Text) { [IO.File]::WriteAllText($Path, $Text, $Utf8); Add-Artifact $Role $Path }\n129\t+# Property failures carry a marker; any other exception inside a case is a setup/runtime error (rc 2), never a test outcome.\n130\t+function Stop-Case([string]$Reason) { $e = [Exception]::new($Reason); $e.Data['pm'] = 1; throw $e }\n131\t+function Invoke-Case([string]$Id, [scriptblock]$Body) {\n132\t+    $caseRec = [ordered]@{ id = $Id; outcome = 'passed'; reason = $null; detail = $null }\n133\t+    try { $caseRec.detail = & $Body } catch { $caseRec.reason = \"$($_.Exception.Message)\"; $caseRec.outcome = $(if ($_.Exception.Data.Contains('pm')) { 'failed' } else { 'setup_error' }) }\n134\t+    $Results.Add([pscustomobject]$caseRec)\n135\t+}\n136\t+function Get-Snapshot([string]$Base) {\n137\t+    $map = [Collections.Generic.SortedDictionary[string, string]]::new([StringComparer]::Ordinal); $todo = [Collections.Generic.Stack[string]]::new(); $todo.Push($Base)\n138\t+    while ($todo.Count) {\n139\t+        foreach ($p in [IO.Directory]::GetFileSystemEntries($todo.Pop())) {\n140\t+            $a = [int][IO.File]::GetAttributes($p); $rel = $p.Substring($Base.Length + 1).Replace([char]'\\', [char]'/')\n141\t+            if ($a -band 0x400) { $map[$rel] = 'reparse' } elseif ($a -band 0x10) { $todo.Push($p) } else { $map[$rel] = Get-FileSha $p }\n142\t+        }\n143\t+    }\n144\t+    return , $map\n145\t+}\n146\t+function ConvertTo-ArgText([string]$T) { if ($T -cmatch '^[A-Za-z0-9_.:/\\\\-]+$') { return $T }; '\"' + (($T -replace '(\\\\*)\"', '$1$1\\\"') -replace '(\\\\+)$', '$1$1') + '\"' }\n147\t+function Start-Child([string]$Role, [string[]]$ArgList, [int]$TimeoutSec) {\n148\t+    $base = [IO.Path]::Combine($Run, ('child{0:d2}-{1}' -f $Children.Count, $Role))\n149\t+    $psi = [Diagnostics.ProcessStartInfo]::new($SelfExe); $psi.Arguments = @($ArgList | ForEach-Object { ConvertTo-ArgText $_ }) -join ' '\n150\t+    $psi.UseShellExecute = $false; $psi.CreateNoWindow = $true; $psi.WorkingDirectory = $Run; foreach ($n in 'Input', 'Output', 'Error') { $psi.\"RedirectStandard$n\" = $true }\n151\t+    $ch = [ordered]@{ role = $Role; exe = $SelfExe; argv = $ArgList; arguments = $psi.Arguments; cwd = $Run; started_utc = [DateTime]::UtcNow.ToString('o', $Inv)\n152\t+        ended_utc = $null; rc = $null; timed_out = $false; stdout = \"$base.stdout.bin\"; stderr = \"$base.stderr.bin\" }\n153\t+    $Children.Add($ch); $so = [IO.MemoryStream]::new(); $se = [IO.MemoryStream]::new(); $proc = [Diagnostics.Process]::Start($psi)\n154\t+    try {\n155\t+        $proc.StandardInput.Close(); $t1 = $proc.StandardOutput.BaseStream.CopyToAsync($so); $t2 = $proc.StandardError.BaseStream.CopyToAsync($se)\n156\t+        if (-not $proc.WaitForExit($TimeoutSec * 1000)) { $ch.timed_out = $true; try { $proc.Kill() } catch { $null = $_ }; $null = $proc.WaitForExit(30000) }\n157\t+        $null = $t1.Wait(30000); $null = $t2.Wait(30000); if ($proc.HasExited) { $ch.rc = $proc.ExitCode }\n158\t+    } finally { $proc.Dispose(); [IO.File]::WriteAllBytes($ch.stdout, $so.ToArray()); [IO.File]::WriteAllBytes($ch.stderr, $se.ToArray()) }\n159\t+    $ch.ended_utc = [DateTime]::UtcNow.ToString('o', $Inv); Add-Artifact \"$Role-stdout\" $ch.stdout; Add-Artifact \"$Role-stderr\" $ch.stderr\n160\t+    Save-Text \"$Role-command\" \"$base.command.json\" ($ch | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 4)\n161\t+    if ($ch.timed_out) { throw \"child $Role timed out after $TimeoutSec s (killed; partial output kept)\" }; return $ch\n162\t+}\n163\t+function Read-Skill([string]$Path) {\n164\t+    $doc = [ordered]@{ text = ''; decode = 'ok'; fm = $null; sections = [Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new(); code = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new() }\n165\t+    try { $doc.text = [IO.File]::ReadAllText($Path, $Utf8) } catch { $doc.decode = 'invalid_utf8' }\n166\t+    $lines = @($doc.text -split \"`r?`n\"); $i = 0; $cur = $null; $lang = $null\n167\t+    if ($lines[0] -ceq '---') {\n168\t+        $fm = [ordered]@{}\n169\t+        for ($i = 1; $i -lt $lines.Count -and $lines[$i] -cne '---'; $i++) { if ($lines[$i] -cmatch '^([a-z]+):\\s*(.*)$') { $fm[$Matches[1]] = $Matches[2].Trim() } }\n170\t+        if ($i -lt $lines.Count) { $doc.fm = $fm; $i++ } else { $i = 0 }\n171\t+    }\n172\t+    for (; $i -lt $lines.Count; $i++) {\n173\t+        $l = $lines[$i]\n174\t+        if ($l -cmatch '^```(\\S*)') { $lang = $(if ($null -eq $lang) { $Matches[1] }); continue }\n175\t+        if ($null -eq $lang -and $l -cmatch '^## (?:.*\\(([^()]+)\\)\\s*|.*)$') { $cur = [pscustomobject]@{ tag = \"$($Matches[1])\"; body = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new() }; $doc.sections.Add($cur); continue }\n176\t+        if ($lang -ceq 'powershell') { $doc.code.Add($l) }\n177\t+        if ($null -ne $cur) { $cur.body.Add($l) }\n178\t+    }\n179\t+    return [pscustomobject]$doc\n180\t+}\n181\t+function Get-Section([string]$Tag) { (@($Doc.sections | Where-Object { $_.tag -ceq $Tag } | ForEach-Object { $_.body }) -join \"`n\") }\n182\t+function Get-DocCommands {\n183\t+    foreach ($line in $Doc.code) {\n184\t+        if (-not $line.Trim() -or $line.TrimStart().StartsWith('#')) { continue }\n185\t+        $tk = $null; $er = $null; $cmd = [Parser]::ParseInput($line, [ref]$tk, [ref]$er).Find({ param($n) $n -is [CommandAst] }, $true)\n186\t+        $item = [pscustomobject]@{ line = $line; errors = @($er).Count; name = ''; action = ''; params = @{} }\n187\t+        if ($null -eq $cmd) { $item; continue }\n188\t+        $el = @($cmd.CommandElements); $item.name = \"$($cmd.GetCommandName())\"\n189\t+        if ($el.Count -gt 1 -and $el[1] -is [StringConstantExpressionAst]) { $item.action = $el[1].Value }\n190\t+        for ($j = 1; $j -lt $el.Count; $j++) {\n191\t+            if ($el[$j] -isnot [CommandParameterAst]) { continue }\n192\t+            $nx = $(if ($j + 1 -lt $el.Count -and $el[$j + 1] -isnot [CommandParameterAst]) { $el[$j + 1] })\n193\t+            $item.params[$el[$j].ParameterName] = $(if ($nx -is [StringConstantExpressionAst]) { $nx.Value } elseif ($null -ne $nx) { $nx.Extent.Text })\n194\t+        }\n195\t+        $item\n196\t+    }\n197\t+}\n198\t+function Complete-Run([int]$Rc) {\n199\t+    if ($script:Completing) { exit 2 }\n200\t+    $script:Completing = $true; $errs = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new(); $n = 0\n201\t+    try {\n202\t+        $nested = @(foreach ($cx in $Report.counterexamples) { if ([IO.File]::Exists($cx.report_path)) { ([IO.File]::ReadAllText($cx.report_path, $Utf8) | ConvertFrom-Json).evidence.artifacts } })\n203\t+        foreach ($a in @($Artifacts) + $nested) { $n++; if (-not $a.sha256 -or (Get-FileSha ([string]$a.path)) -cne [string]$a.sha256) { $errs.Add(\"EVIDENCE_MISSING_OR_CHANGED[$($a.role) $($a.path)]\") } }\n204\t+    } catch { $errs.Add(\"EVIDENCE_CHECK_ERROR $($_.Exception.Message)\") }\n205\t+    $Report.evidence.check = [ordered]@{ status = $(if ($errs.Count) { 'failed' } else { 'ok' }); verified = $n; errors = @($errs); scope = 'own + nested CX artifacts, after all cases' }\n206\t+    $Report.cleanup = [ordered]@{ status = 'ok'; policy = 'retain_all: this run deletes nothing; evidence is re-hashed instead'; deleted = 0; retained_dir = $Run }; if ($errs.Count) { $Rc = 2 }\n207\t+    foreach ($oc in 'failed', 'setup_error') { $Report[\"$($oc)_ids\"] = @($Results | Where-Object { $_.outcome -ceq $oc } | ForEach-Object { $_.id }) }\n208\t+    $Report.passed = @($Results | Where-Object { $_.outcome -ceq 'passed' }).Count; $Report.total = $Results.Count; $Report.harness_sha256 = Get-FileSha $PSCommandPath\n209\t+    $Report.runtime_children = @($Children | Where-Object { $_.role -ceq 'runtime' -or $_.role -ceq 'tamper' }).Count\n210\t+    try { [IO.File]::WriteAllText($ReportPath, ($Report | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 8), $Utf8) } catch { Write-Host \"REPORT_WRITE_ERROR $($_.Exception.Message)\"; $Rc = 2 }\n211\t+    Write-Host ('RESULT {0}/{1} passed; failed_ids=[{2}]; setup_error_ids=[{3}]; manifest={4}; skill={5}; setup_error={6}; evidence={7}; rc={8}' -f $Report.passed, $Report.total,\n212\t+        ($Report.failed_ids -join ','), ($Report.setup_error_ids -join ','), $Report.manifest_state, $Report.skill_state, $Report.setup_error, $Report.evidence.check.status, $Rc)\n213\t+    exit $Rc\n214\t+}\n215\t+trap { $Report.setup_error = \"$($_.Exception.Message)\"; Write-Host \"SETUP_ERROR $($Report.setup_error)\"; Complete-Run 2 }\n216\t+$ChildScript = @'\n217\t+# runtime (PM03+PM06): Test-ModuleManifest, manifest import, px help, then the UNCHANGED Run-Px.ps1 help in this same process with a test-owned\n218\t+# in-memory sentinel in the module. tamper (PM04): import a private copy whose ProximaConfig.psm1 has a harmless sentinel line; S2 must reject it.\n219\t+param([string]$Mode, [string]$ManifestPath, [string]$SentinelPath, [string]$OutPath)\n220\t+Set-StrictMode -Version 3.0; $ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\n221\t+$r = [ordered]@{ mode = $Mode; ps_version = \"$($PSVersionTable.PSVersion)\"; ps_edition = \"$($PSVersionTable.PSEdition)\"; culture = [Globalization.CultureInfo]::CurrentCulture.Name\n222\t+    preloaded = @(Get-Module -Name ProximaControl, ProximaConfig | ForEach-Object { $_.Path }); test_manifest = $null; module = $null; help = $null; wrapper = $null\n223\t+    imported = $false; error = $null; messages = @(); sentinel_exists = $false; loaded_after = @() }\n224\t+$scripts = [IO.Path]::GetDirectoryName($ManifestPath)\n225\t+try {\n226\t+    if ($Mode -ceq 'tamper') { $null = Import-Module -Name $ManifestPath -DisableNameChecking -ErrorAction Stop; $r.imported = $true; return }\n227\t+    $tm = Test-ModuleManifest -Path $ManifestPath -ErrorAction Stop; $r.test_manifest = [ordered]@{ version = \"$($tm.Version)\"; guid = \"$($tm.Guid)\"; root_module = \"$($tm.RootModule)\" }\n228\t+    $m = Import-Module -Name $ManifestPath -PassThru -Global -DisableNameChecking -ErrorAction Stop; $r.imported = $true\n229\t+    $r.module = [ordered]@{ path = $m.Path; version = \"$($m.Version)\"; guid = \"$($m.Guid)\"; commands = @($m.ExportedCommands.Keys); functions = @($m.ExportedFunctions.Keys).Count\n230\t+        others = @($m.ExportedCmdlets.Keys).Count + @($m.ExportedAliases.Keys).Count + @($m.ExportedVariables.Keys).Count; loaded = @(Get-Module -Name ProximaControl).Count\n231\t+        path_is_root_module = [string]::Equals([IO.Path]::GetFullPath($m.Path), [IO.Path]::Combine($scripts, 'ProximaControl.psm1'), [StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase) }\n232\t+    $h = & $m.ExportedCommands['px'] help; $r.help = [ordered]@{ schema = \"$($h.schema)\"; action = \"$($h.action)\"; outcome = \"$($h.outcome)\"; first = \"$(@($h.data)[0])\" }\n233\t+    $tok = [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'); & $m { param($t) $script:PmSentinel = $t } $tok\n234\t+    $w = [ordered]@{ action = $null; outcome = $null; error = $null; conflict = $false; loaded_after = 0; same_instance = $false; sentinel_intact = $false }\n235\t+    try { $wo = @(& ([IO.Path]::Combine($scripts, 'Run-Px.ps1')) help); if ($wo.Count) { $w.action = \"$($wo[0].action)\"; $w.outcome = \"$($wo[0].outcome)\" } }\n236\t+    catch { $w.error = \"$($_.FullyQualifiedErrorId) | $($_.Exception.Message)\"; $w.conflict = \"$($_.FullyQualifiedErrorId)\".StartsWith('ProximaControl.ModuleConflict', [StringComparison]::Ordinal) }\n237\t+    $after = @(Get-Module -Name ProximaControl); $w.loaded_after = $after.Count\n238\t+    $w.same_instance = $after.Count -eq 1 -and [object]::ReferenceEquals($after[0].PSObject.BaseObject, $m.PSObject.BaseObject)\n239\t+    $w.sentinel_intact = $after.Count -eq 1 -and ((& $after[0] { Get-Variable -Name PmSentinel -Scope Script -ValueOnly -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue }) -ceq $tok)\n240\t+    $r.wrapper = $w\n241\t+} catch {\n242\t+    $r.error = \"$($_.FullyQualifiedErrorId) | $($_.Exception.Message)\"; $x = $_.Exception\n243\t+    while ($null -ne $x) { $r.messages += $x.Message; if ($x -is [Management.Automation.IContainsErrorRecord]) { $r.messages += \"$($x.ErrorRecord.FullyQualifiedErrorId)\" }; $x = $x.InnerException }\n244\t+} finally {\n245\t+    $r.sentinel_exists = [bool]$SentinelPath -and [IO.File]::Exists($SentinelPath); $r.loaded_after = @(Get-Module -Name ProximaControl, ProximaConfig | ForEach-Object { $_.Path })\n246\t+    [IO.File]::WriteAllText($OutPath, ($r | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 5), [Text.UTF8Encoding]::new($false))\n247\t+}\n248\t+'@\n249\t+function Invoke-Phase([string]$Role, [string[]]$More) {\n250\t+    $s = [IO.Path]::Combine($Run, \"$Role-child.ps1\"); $o = [IO.Path]::Combine($Run, \"$Role-child.out.json\"); Save-Text \"$Role-script\" $s $ChildScript\n251\t+    $c = Start-Child $Role (@('-NoProfile', '-NonInteractive', '-File', $s, '-Mode', $Role, '-OutPath', $o) + $More) 300\n252\t+    if (-not [IO.File]::Exists($o)) { throw \"$Role child wrote no output (rc=$($c.rc))\" }; Add-Artifact \"$Role-output\" $o; return ([IO.File]::ReadAllText($o, $Utf8) | ConvertFrom-Json)\n253\t+}\n254\t+$Root = [IO.Path]::GetFullPath($AddonRoot).TrimEnd([char]'\\', [char]'/'); $Scratch = [IO.Path]::GetFullPath($ScratchRoot); $ReportPath = [IO.Path]::GetFullPath($ReportPath)\n255\t+if (-not [IO.Directory]::Exists($Root) -or -not [IO.Directory]::Exists($Scratch)) { throw 'AddonRoot and ScratchRoot must be existing directories' }\n256\t+foreach ($rel in $Legacy) { if (-not [IO.File]::Exists((Join-Addon $Root $rel))) { throw \"S1/S2 file missing: $rel (not a proxima-control add-on tree)\" } }\n257\t+$RepoTop = $null; $probe = [IO.Directory]::GetParent($Root)\n258\t+while ($null -ne $probe -and $null -eq $RepoTop) { if ([IO.Directory]::Exists(\"$($probe.FullName)/.git\") -or [IO.File]::Exists(\"$($probe.FullName)/.git\")) { $RepoTop = $probe.FullName }; $probe = $probe.Parent }\n259\t+foreach ($p in $Scratch, $ReportPath) { if ((Test-Inside $p $Root) -or ($RepoTop -and (Test-Inside $p $RepoTop))) { throw \"evidence path inside the add-on or its repository: $p\" } }\n260\t+if (@(Get-Module -Name ProximaControl, ProximaConfig).Count) { throw 'a Proxima module is already loaded in this process; run the harness in a fresh process' }\n261\t+$SelfExe = [Diagnostics.Process]::GetCurrentProcess().MainModule.FileName\n262\t+$Run = [IO.Path]::Combine($Scratch, ('pm-{0}-{1}' -f [DateTime]::UtcNow.ToString('yyyyMMddTHHmmssZ', $Inv), [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N').Substring(0, 8)))\n263\t+$null = [IO.Directory]::CreateDirectory($Run); $Report.evidence.dir = $Run\n264\t+$Report.launch = [ordered]@{ exe = $SelfExe; command_line = [Environment]::CommandLine; execution_policy_preference = $env:PSExecutionPolicyPreference; repository = $RepoTop }\n265\t+$Before = Get-Snapshot $Root; $Report.source_hashes = $Before\n266\t+$ManifestPath = Join-Addon $Root 'scripts/ProximaControl.psd1'; $SkillPath = Join-Addon $Root 'SKILL.md'; $ManifestPresent = [IO.File]::Exists($ManifestPath)\n267\t+$SkillPresent = [IO.File]::Exists($SkillPath); $Doc = $null; $DocCommands = @(); $ManifestAst = $null; $ManifestData = $null; $SchemaOk = $false\n268\t+$Report.manifest_state = $(if ($ManifestPresent) { 'present' } else { 'MANIFEST_ABSENT' }); $Report.skill_state = $(if ($SkillPresent) { 'present' } else { 'SKILL_ABSENT' })\n269\t+if ($SkillPresent) { $Doc = Read-Skill $SkillPath; $DocCommands = @(Get-DocCommands) }\n270\t+# ---- PM01/PM02: static manifest judgement, BEFORE any import ----\n271\t+Invoke-Case 'PM01' {\n272\t+    if (-not $ManifestPresent) { Stop-Case 'MANIFEST_ABSENT: scripts/ProximaControl.psd1' }\n273\t+    $tk = $null; $er = $null; $ast = [Parser]::ParseFile($ManifestPath, [ref]$tk, [ref]$er); if (@($er).Count) { Stop-Case \"PARSE_ERROR: $(@($er)[0].Message)\" }\n274\t+    # WP1285-R1-F01: allow data nodes and child edges throughout the tree, before SafeGetValue. Reflection feature-detects PS7 properties on PS5.1.\n275\t+    # All execution flags must be false except the root end block's Unnamed; comments and literal string characters are not executable structure.\n276\t+    $shape = @{ ScriptBlockAst = @('EndBlock'); NamedBlockAst = @('Statements'); PipelineAst = @('PipelineElements')\n277\t+        CommandExpressionAst = @('Expression'); HashtableAst = @('KeyValuePairs'); StatementBlockAst = @('Statements')\n278\t+        ArrayExpressionAst = @('SubExpression'); ArrayLiteralAst = @('Elements'); StringConstantExpressionAst = @() }\n279\t+    if (@($tk | Where-Object { $_.Kind -eq [TokenKind]::Comment -and $_.Text -imatch '^#\\s*requires' }).Count -or $null -eq $ast.EndBlock -or\n280\t+        -not $ast.EndBlock.Unnamed -or $ast.EndBlock.Traps) { Stop-Case 'EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: requires/named block/trap' }\n281\t+    foreach ($node in $ast.FindAll({ param($n) $true }, $true)) {\n282\t+        $kind = $node.GetType().Name; if (-not $shape.ContainsKey($kind)) { Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: node $kind\" }\n283\t+        if ($node -is [PipelineAst] -and @($node.PipelineElements).Count -ne 1) { Stop-Case 'EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: chained pipeline' }\n284\t+        foreach ($pr in $node.GetType().GetProperties([Reflection.BindingFlags]'Public, Instance')) {\n285\t+            if ($pr.Name -ceq 'Parent') { continue }; $v = $pr.GetValue($node)\n286\t+            if ($pr.Name -ceq 'Background') { if ($v) { Stop-Case 'EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: background pipeline' }; continue }\n287\t+            if (($pr.PropertyType -eq [bool] -and $v -ne ($kind -ceq 'NamedBlockAst' -and $pr.Name -ceq 'Unnamed')) -or\n288\t+                (($v -is [Ast] -or ($v -is [Collections.ICollection] -and $v.Count)) -and $pr.Name -cnotin $shape[$kind])) { Stop-Case \"EXECUTABLE_STATEMENT: $kind.$($pr.Name)\" }\n289\t+        }\n290\t+    }\n291\t+    $st = @(if ($ast.EndBlock) { $ast.EndBlock.Statements })\n292\t+    $ce = $(if ($st.Count -eq 1 -and $st[0] -is [PipelineAst] -and @($st[0].PipelineElements).Count -eq 1) { $st[0].PipelineElements[0] })\n293\t+    if ($ce -isnot [CommandExpressionAst] -or @($ce.Redirections).Count -or $ce.Expression -isnot [HashtableAst]) { Stop-Case \"NOT_SINGLE_HASHTABLE: $($st.Count) top-level statement(s)\" }\n294\t+    try { $data = $ce.Expression.SafeGetValue() } catch { Stop-Case \"UNSAFE_VALUE: $($_.Exception.Message)\" }\n295\t+    $script:ManifestAst = $ce.Expression; $script:ManifestData = $data; 'plain unnamed end block with exactly one hashtable data expression; SafeGetValue accepted'\n296\t+}\n297\t+Invoke-Case 'PM02' {\n298\t+    if (-not $ManifestPresent) { Stop-Case 'MANIFEST_ABSENT: scripts/ProximaControl.psd1' } elseif ($null -eq $ManifestAst) { Stop-Case 'NOT_EVALUATED: PM01 rejected the manifest' }\n299\t+    $bad = [Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new(); $seen = [Collections.Generic.HashSet[string]]::new([StringComparer]::Ordinal)\n300\t+    foreach ($kv in $ManifestAst.KeyValuePairs) {\n301\t+        $name = $(if ($kv.Item1 -is [StringConstantExpressionAst]) { $kv.Item1.Value } else { $kv.Item1.Extent.Text })\n302\t+        if (-not $KeySet.Contains($name)) { $bad.Add(\"UNEXPECTED_KEY[$name]\") } elseif (-not $seen.Add($name)) { $bad.Add(\"DUPLICATE_KEY[$name]\") }\n303\t+    }\n304\t+    foreach ($k in $KeySet) { if (-not $seen.Contains($k)) { $bad.Add(\"MISSING_KEY[$k]\") } }\n305\t+    foreach ($k in $Want.Keys) { if ($ManifestData[$k] -isnot [string] -or -not [string]::Equals($ManifestData[$k], $Want[$k], [StringComparison]::Ordinal)) { $bad.Add(\"VALUE[$k]\") } }\n306\t+    foreach ($k in $WantArrays.Keys) {\n307\t+        $v = $ManifestData[$k]; $w = @($WantArrays[$k])\n308\t+        if ($v -isnot [object[]]) { $bad.Add(\"TYPE[$k]\"); continue }\n309\t+        # Wildcards are invalid even though the unchanged S2 Export-ModuleMember would hide them at runtime (actual exports cannot see this).\n310\t+        if (@($v | Where-Object { \"$_\".IndexOfAny([char[]]'*?[') -ge 0 }).Count) { $bad.Add(\"WILDCARD_EXPORT[$k]\") }\n311\t+        $same = $v.Count -eq $w.Count; for ($i = 0; $same -and $i -lt $w.Count; $i++) { $same = $v[$i] -is [string] -and [string]::Equals($v[$i], $w[$i], [StringComparison]::Ordinal) }\n312\t+        if (-not $same) { $bad.Add(\"VALUE[$k]\") }\n313\t+    }\n314\t+    if ($bad.Count) { Stop-Case ($bad -join '; ') }\n315\t+    $script:SchemaOk = $true; 'nine allowed keys exactly; RootModule/ModuleVersion/GUID/PS metadata and Ordinal export arrays as specified; no wildcard'\n316\t+}\n317\t+$RtOut = $null; $TaOut = $null; $RtSetup = $null; $TaSetup = $null; $Tamper = $null\n318\t+if ($SchemaOk) {\n319\t+    try { $RtOut = Invoke-Phase 'runtime' @('-ManifestPath', $ManifestPath) } catch { $RtSetup = \"$($_.Exception.Message)\" }\n320\t+    try {\n321\t+        $td = [IO.Path]::Combine($Run, 'pm04-private-copy'); $ts = [IO.Path]::Combine($td, 'scripts'); $null = [IO.Direc